# E00-28: PendingIntentImmutable exceptions. FLAG_MUTABLE is denied by default; a call site that
# genuinely needs it (e.g. a media-session callback PendingIntent the system must be able to fill
# in extras on) gets one line here:
#
#   <containing file name>#<enclosing function name>  — <issue ID> — <reason>
#
# Matched by containing-file-name + enclosing-function-simple-name only (the rule has no
# fully-qualified-name resolution); only the first whitespace-separated token is read, the rest is
# a human-readable comment. Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# Nothing is allowlisted yet.
